UID:om69AVCIjM
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 166 mins (2h46m)\n\nScience teacher Ryland Grace (Ry
 an Gosling) wakes up on a spaceship light years from home with no recollec
 tion of who he is or how he got there. As his memory returns\, he begins t
 o uncover his mission: solve the riddle of the mysterious substance causin
 g the sun to die out.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/project-h
 ail-mary\n\nEstimated start: 15:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
